{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S08-1\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"熟悉的柔软、曾经获得的满足和舍不得推开，都承接了前文已有的心理事实，没有扩写成具体场景、往事画面或实际行动。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S08-2\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"上回的安宁指向前文已经出现的柔软与满足，缓过来是对其心理效果的概括，没有凭空增加外部事件或具体往事。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S08-3\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"喘过一口气表达短暂的心理舒缓，安静不会久留则承接珠子里的短暂性，没有把比喻扩写成具体场景或实际行动。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"links\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-6\",\n      \"to\": \"S08-1\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"S06-6已经写出满足与柔软涌现、越想越舍不得离开，足以解释这份熟悉的柔软再次靠近及他不愿推开。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S08-1\",\n      \"label\": \"勉强\",\n      \"why\": \"S07-3解释了他为何处于为难和难以定心的状态，却没有直接解释熟悉的柔软为何再次靠近。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"readable\": \"是\",\n  \"readable_why\": \"只读线也能读出熟悉的柔软重新出现、他因曾获得满足而愿意多停留一会儿，最后在短暂舒缓中意识到安静不会久留并生出不舍。 \",\n  \"lost\": [],\n  \"unexplained\": [],\n  \"wordy\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "adb33006-c871-4543-ba75-be00d8cce1db", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T101513611227Z", "elapsed_seconds": 336.203, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T10:20:49.826422+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "512dfe91abc03f7a02f179b99813b3835902f57021e33fb026b5fef957741aa0", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef